                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "2da17495-8691-5696-bd53-f949d4ef7fe3",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/text"
                },
                ":answer/value": "$\\lambda =-3$ and $\\mu =-2$",
                ":db/id": 17592186254079
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "9518d0fa-8d58-5ea0-85af-33850d0ea420",
              ":answer-field/key": "selection",
              ":answer-field/type": {
                ":db/ident": ":answer-field.type/radio"
              },
              ":db/id": 17592186256195
            }
          ],
          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
          },
          ":question/id": "b4d0ef3c-f0b3-5fa4-b071-4e8740b424bd",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-120281",
          ":question/problem": "![](images/41/41a40c03043152177c5bf6d7f56b51c09e57352480599b508d376018d87de1b3.png)\n\nConsider the picture above. Given that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda \\mathbf{a}+\\mu \\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda $ and $\\mu .$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "![](images/cc/ccc52cbcbf17db97ad3849f157b5d6ab3e10f59846e2cd4b75507fc0a37c3c98.png)\n\nIn $△OAC$ shown above, we have:\n\n- $OA=3|\\mathbf{a}|$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{OA}$ and $\\mathbf{a}$ have opposite directions\n\nHence, $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=-3\\mathbf{a}.$\n\nSimilarly:\n\n- $AC=2|\\mathbf{b}|$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ have opposite directions\n\nHence, $\\overset{\\to }{AC}=-2\\mathbf{b}.$\n\nAdditionally, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{c} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC} \\\\  & =-3\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsequently, $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda \\mathbf{a}+\\mu \\mathbf{b}=-3\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}.$ \n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}∦\\mathbf{b},$ the linear combination can only be written in one way. Equating the coefficients, we get:\n\n- $\\lambda =-3$ and $\\mu =-2$"
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186292807,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "6e5ae413-be1a-5211-ad08-178e5e19be0a",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "-\\frac{5}{2}",
                  ":db/id": 17592186291107
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "6e5ae413-be1a-5211-ad08-178e5e19be0a",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "-\\frac{5}{2}",
                ":db/id": 17592186291107
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "2daa9284-83e4-5449-8185-db49a6c674e4",
              ":answer-field/key": "field-2",
              ":answer-field/type": {
                ":db/ident": ":answer-field.type/blank"
              },
              ":db/id": 17592186291887
            },
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "8d709123-c548-51c1-96cd-bc8ac660e378",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "-\\frac{1}{2}",
                  ":db/id": 17592186291236
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "8d709123-c548-51c1-96cd-bc8ac660e378",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "-\\frac{1}{2}",
                ":db/id": 17592186291236
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "956ba8d7-fa47-5f7a-b145-9f5e1da669dd",
              ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
