          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
          },
          ":question/id": "d5f98ecb-0f26-50ae-9a82-cc334fd82c55",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-20413",
          ":question/problem": "![](images/4b/4bb7598c9ebae28be572508974cd025caa8f4a6c3313f025ff0f5ca55296334e.png)\n\nConsider the picture above. Given that $\\mathbf{h}=\\lambda \\mathbf{f}+\\mu \\mathbf{g}$, find $\\lambda $ and $\\mu .$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "![](images/43/43642acdb991827b4e1e16744e8a69507a383a1319ae07efde78480af4bab166.png)\n\nIn $△OFH$ shown above, we have \n\n- $OF=2|\\mathbf{g}|$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{OF}$ and $\\mathbf{g}$ have the same direction\n\nHence, $\\overset{\\to }{OF}=2\\mathbf{g}.$\n\nSimilarly:\n\n- $FH=3|\\mathbf{f}|$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{FH}$ has the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{f}$\n\nHence, $\\overset{\\to }{FH}=-3\\mathbf{f}.$\n\nAdditionally, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{h} & =\\overset{\\to }{OF}+\\overset{\\to }{FH} \\\\  & =2\\mathbf{g}-3\\mathbf{f} \\\\  & =-3\\mathbf{f}+2\\mathbf{g}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsequently, $\\mathbf{h}=\\lambda \\mathbf{f}+\\mu \\mathbf{g}=-3\\mathbf{f}+2\\mathbf{g}.$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{f}∦\\mathbf{g},$ the linear combination can only be written in one way. Equating the coefficients, we get:\n\n- $\\lambda =-3$ and $\\mu =2$"
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186514754,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "3bd94222-3648-5492-8241-4b010da5c333",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\frac{1}{4}",
                  ":db/id": 17592186514759
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "3bd94222-3648-5492-8241-4b010da5c333",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{1}{4}",
                ":db/id": 17592186514759
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "01a589e1-3968-5f24-a7a9-df5b3459d167",
