          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/easy"
          },
          ":question/id": "7c292858-d7b0-5c40-8822-29c35ab71cb9",
          ":question/problem": "![](images/d5/d590fd2fe368f5f7b460a2e0ec070d92c08b450184372a795e6823985a7df649.png)\n\nConsider the picture above. If $\\mathbf{r}=\\lambda \\mathbf{p}+\\mu \\mathbf{q}$, then$\\,\\lambda =$\n{{field-1}}\nand \n$\\mu =$\n{{field-2}}.",
          ":question/worked-solution": "![](images/2c/2cfab6eaeb4098a384c7807fcd34d7503d2b17d8188f9a6be2e387a4f57a3229.png)\n\nIn $△OPR$ shown above, we have:\n\n- $OP=3|\\mathbf{p}|$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{OP}$ and $\\mathbf{p}$ have the same direction\n\nHence, $\\overset{\\to }{OP}=3\\mathbf{p}.$\n\nSimilarly:\n\n- $PR=4|\\mathbf{q}|$\n\n- $\\overset{\\to }{PR}$ and $\\mathbf{q}$ have the same direction\n\nHence, $\\overset{\\to }{PR}=4\\mathbf{q}.$\n\nAdditionally, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{r} & =\\overset{\\to }{OP}+\\overset{\\to }{PR} \\\\  & =3\\mathbf{p}+4\\mathbf{q}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsequently, $\\mathbf{r}=\\lambda \\mathbf{p}+\\mu \\mathbf{q}=3\\mathbf{p}+4\\mathbf{q}.$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{p}∦\\mathbf{q},$ the linear combination can only be written in one way. Equating the coefficients, we get:\n\n- $\\lambda =3$ and $\\mu =4$"
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186514779,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "1d1a6dd2-8d44-57d0-888e-7233819d1e28",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\frac{3}{2}",
                  ":db/id": 17592186514753
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "1d1a6dd2-8d44-57d0-888e-7233819d1e28",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{3}{2}",
                ":db/id": 17592186514753
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "2f2b8574-b828-57ad-9236-3ab32e3e7989",
              ":answer-field/key": "field-2",
              ":answer-field/type": {
                ":db/ident": ":answer-field.type/blank"
              },
              ":db/id": 17592186514756
            },
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "241831da-eaa7-564a-a150-2d9953025324",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "-\\frac{11}{3}",
                  ":db/id": 17592186514755
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "241831da-eaa7-564a-a150-2d9953025324",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "-\\frac{11}{3}",
                ":db/id": 17592186514755
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "a2b2f95f-1ac6-5ddd-8eb5-57a7fdc6944b",
              ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
