          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/hard"
          },
          ":question/id": "c62a9e0e-7283-5db6-8603-4fc28da1e7a9",
          ":question/problem": "The vectors are drawn on a square grid, and $\\mathbf{c}=\\overrightarrow{OC}$.\n\n![Vector diagram on a square grid](images/da/da826185105dfc1ec4e45b6b32c7a7da6da33bb1a27aed665f9b67fadae4128c.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}",
          ":question/worked-solution": "![Completed vector path](images/c2/c2bcb1d71d99d24ae325386c8b99146b5854c6186b0f25ce64bfe24cf8379ef8.png)\n\nConstruct a route $O\\to X\\to C$ whose first segment is parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$ and whose second segment is parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$. The added dashed lines show this route.\n\nA copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves one square right and two squares up. The segment from $O$ to $X$ moves three squares right and six squares up, so $OX=3|\\mathbf{b}|$ with the same direction. Thus $\\overrightarrow{OX}=3\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nA copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves two squares right and one square up. From $X$ to $C$, move four squares left and two squares down. The length is $2|\\mathbf{a}|$, but the direction is opposite, so $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\\mathbf{a}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\\n&=3\\mathbf{b}-2\\mathbf{a}\\\\\n&=-2\\mathbf{a}+3\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBecause $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, this expression is unique. Match each coefficient to its vector, rather than to the order of travel: $\\lambda=-2$ and $\\mu=3$."
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186735008,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "122433f9-4f97-5f10-b51e-cae32384b524",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "2",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735000
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "122433f9-4f97-5f10-b51e-cae32384b524",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "2",
                ":db/id": 17592186735000
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "20403580-572a-5e11-89dc-40453809e0ce",
              ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
              ":answer-field/type": {
