          ":question/problem": "![](images/fb/fb31653c9fc5031372c4b08e8fba0ec809c7e58a7a2321a8a7eb027b8eacd48a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overrightarrow{OP} = \\mathbf{p}$, $\\overrightarrow{OQ} = \\mathbf{q}$ and $R$ divides $\\overline{PQ}$ in the ratio $PR: RQ = 1: 2$. Find $\\overrightarrow{OR}$."
