          ":question/problem": "![](images/7e/7e92a09f8448f4d320f86656bc0774e6167b96156041c32eb7a64ba5e8820128.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=\\mathbf{d},$ $\\overset{\\to }{OE}=\\mathbf{e},$ and $F$ divides $\\overline{DE}$ in the ratio $DF:FE=3:4.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OF}$ via the vectors $\\mathbf{d}$ and $\\mathbf{e}.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OF}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\mathbf{d}+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\mathbf{e}$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OF}=\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=\\mathbf{d},$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{DF}.$\n\nFirst, from $△ODE,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =\\overset{\\to }{DO}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{d}+\\mathbf{e} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $DF:FE=3:4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{DF}=\\frac{3}{7}\\overset{\\to }{DE}=\\frac{3}{7}(\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OF} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{d}+\\frac{3}{7}(\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{7}\\mathbf{d}+\\frac{3}{7}\\mathbf{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
