          ":question/id": "9ffb1bcc-dc77-57f7-bbf7-ebbfb77cb2d8",
          ":question/problem": "![](images/ac/ac0f436bec28da6334eafc7ce7309820caa547d093398eb752d5fb14ef068b8c.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=\\mathbf{a},$ $\\overset{\\to }{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$ and $T$ divides $\\overline{AB}$ in the ratio $AT:TB=1:4.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OT}$ via the vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OT}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\mathbf{a}+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\mathbf{b}$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AT}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=\\mathbf{a},$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{AT}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OAB,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $AT:TB=1:4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{AT}=\\frac{1}{5}\\overset{\\to }{AB}=\\frac{1}{5}(\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OT} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AT} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{5}(\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{5}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{5}\\mathbf{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
        },
