          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
          },
          ":question/id": "7c2fc166-4fc0-5591-b601-92d5bf18aaa7",
          ":question/problem": "![](images/0b/0b7754ad8bf465342865ba082a613c18d572273987e2486566450317ca804bc7.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $X$ lies on the segment $AB$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OA}=a$ and $\\overrightarrow{OB}=b$. The lengths satisfy $AX:XB=2:3$. Express $\\overrightarrow{OX}$ in terms of $a$ and $b$ by filling in the two coefficients.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OX}=$ {{field-1}} $a+$ {{field-2}} $b$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "Trace the path $O\\to A\\to X$:\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\overrightarrow{AX}.\n$$\nFirst express the full segment vector using the path $A\\to O\\to B$:\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\overrightarrow{AO}+\\overrightarrow{OB}=-a+b=b-a.\n$$\nSince $AX:XB=2:3$, the vector from $A$ to $X$ is $\\frac{2}{5}$ of the vector from $A$ to $B$:\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{AX}=\\frac{2}{5}(b-a).\n$$\nTherefore,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OX}&=a+\\frac{2}{5}(b-a)\\\\\n&=\\frac{3}{5}a+\\frac{2}{5}b.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe coefficients of $a$ and $b$ are $\\frac{3}{5}$ and $\\frac{2}{5}$, respectively."
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186734994,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "047e7256-a900-5298-ae30-30ee4bb5fa1a",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OX}=a+\\frac{1}{3}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186734982
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "0740322b-5cd6-5a20-a2f7-872248fe6012",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\frac{2}{3}a-\\frac{1}{3}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186734983
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "4ad7fe8b-9562-57aa-828e-74b3ed1a1879",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\frac{1}{3}a+\\frac{2}{3}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186734988
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "82abc0b4-e9ef-5962-a472-35d338d89ecd",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\frac{2}{3}a+\\frac{1}{3}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186734991
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "bb44c279-41ed-5de9-ae39-26786f8080e3",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{1}{2}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186734996
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "82abc0b4-e9ef-5962-a472-35d338d89ecd",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\frac{2}{3}a+\\frac{1}{3}b",
                ":db/id": 17592186734991
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "89d4fa47-018f-5bcc-b844-a7469ddaf479",
              ":answer-field/key": "selection",
