          ],
          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/easy"
          },
          ":question/id": "accb9340-cec8-58c2-8094-78507d92299d",
          ":question/problem": "![](images/6a/6a25f87080a52c536be8a179cf922bfddf0608a6d3933a6e99cb4b88a3babcf6.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $X$ lies on the segment $AB$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OA}=a$ and $\\overrightarrow{OB}=b$. The lengths satisfy $AX:XB=1:2$.\n\nUse the path\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\overrightarrow{AX}\n$$\nand the given relation $\\overrightarrow{AB}=b-a$ to find $\\overrightarrow{OX}$ in terms of $a$ and $b$.",
          ":question/worked-solution": "The ratio $AX:XB=1:2$ splits $AB$ into $1+2=3$ equal parts. Since $\\overrightarrow{AX}$ points from $A$ toward $B$,\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{AX}=\\frac{1}{3}\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\frac{1}{3}(b-a).\n$$\nFollowing the supplied path gives\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OX}&=\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\overrightarrow{AX}\\\\\n&=a+\\frac{1}{3}(b-a)\\\\\n&=\\frac{2}{3}a+\\frac{1}{3}b.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe larger coefficient belongs to $a$: $X$ is closer to $A$ than to $B$."
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186735290,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "63155d9f-94cd-5604-ae8c-e54170257816",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{11}{14}p+\\frac{3}{14}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735295
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "7052a1d6-5cf9-5174-bbc5-c666c23ee425",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{1}{2}p+\\frac{1}{2}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735297
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "ec4c7f6f-b46c-5288-9275-b9a02ffcfe57",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{22}{25}p+\\frac{3}{25}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735310
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "efa136db-5b5c-54be-85a9-98d824f6dc37",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{3}{14}p+\\frac{11}{14}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735311
                },
                {
                  ":answer/id": "f4712a5a-f8eb-53c3-ab18-591d2259affd",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{3}{25}p+\\frac{22}{25}b",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735312
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "63155d9f-94cd-5604-ae8c-e54170257816",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{11}{14}p+\\frac{3}{14}b",
                ":db/id": 17592186735295
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "95b1eb64-8793-59fd-8dc9-fcbc719634a0",
              ":answer-field/key": "selection",
