          ":question/difficulty": {
            ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/hard"
          },
          ":question/id": "365903ba-b5ab-557b-8e0c-2efc9ac1761a",
          ":question/problem": "The arrows show $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf a$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf b$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf c$. Solid grid lines are one unit apart; dotted lines divide each square in half.\n\n![](images/3f/3f3d535d41f1efaf3cd1ab6af134c8264583281d49007aa1d272b84c5f04fe6c.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\lambda\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}.",
          ":question/worked-solution": "Construct the known component $\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}$ from $O$, and call its endpoint $P$. Count signed horizontal and vertical grid displacements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OP} &=\\frac{5}{2}\\,(-3, 2)=\\left(-\\frac{15}{2}, 5\\right). \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{PC} &=(-4, 4).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](images/5d/5d25ca9ee6973a180e4aa36d516544c9f2e1f42c38a44b9c037e9dc4829ceedc.png)\n\nCompare the remaining displacement with $\\mathbf{b}$, whose grid displacement is $(-4, 4)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Horizontal scale} &=\\frac{-4}{-4}=1 \\\\\n\\text{Vertical scale} &=\\frac{4}{4}=1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe scale is positive, so the remaining vector has the same direction as $\\mathbf{b}$. Thus $\\overrightarrow{PC}=\\mathbf{b}$. By the triangle law,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c} &=\\overrightarrow{OP}+\\overrightarrow{PC} \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b} \\\\\n&=\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, so their coefficients are unique. Matching the coefficient of $\\mathbf{b}$ gives $\\lambda=1$."
        },
        {
          ":db/id": 17592186735419,
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/choices": [
                {
                  ":answer/id": "fc9339a3-4ba8-5fed-81dd-9363559afd0f",
                  ":answer/type": {
                    ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                  },
                  ":answer/value": "\\frac{1}{4}",
                  ":db/id": 17592186735424
                }
              ],
              ":answer-field/correct": {
                ":answer/id": "fc9339a3-4ba8-5fed-81dd-9363559afd0f",
                ":answer/type": {
                  ":db/ident": ":answer.type/math"
                },
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{1}{4}",
                ":db/id": 17592186735424
              },
              ":answer-field/id": "91e00cee-ce43-5832-a32a-792f28141f58",
              ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
              ":answer-field/type": {
